{"des":"熔火中的调研-研究员斯纳尔互动完成","script":"s_5_10_2_y","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这就是熔火护盾吗？看起来似乎很强大的样子。[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]让我看看……这个防御效果很不错啊！握在手上就感觉充满了力量！[l]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_4","text":"制作方法也很简单。"},{"tag":"tag_4","text":"我来教你们，马上就能学会。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]太好了，这样护卫队就能抵挡住那群熔火元素了。即便不敌，也能争取足够时间让调查队安全撤离。[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]兄弟姐妹们，把你们收集到的熔火结晶都拿过来。如果能把这些熔火结晶全部做成熔火护盾，这样我们就能抵挡那群魔物的攻击了！[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好——！[l][cm]","charaName":"众人"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哇……经历了这么激烈的逃亡，大家还是那么有干劲啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]毕竟我们也是一群富有探险精神的研究员，研究这种远古遗迹实在太有趣了。[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]还得感谢三位出手相助啊，这样我们对瓦菲诺也有交代了。[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]来，报酬给你们，辛苦了！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}